+   ```markdown
+   Step 4 — parallel verifier dispatch.
+
+   For each finding-file enumerated in Step 1, dispatch one Task call:
+
+     subagent_type: qrspi-finding-verifier
+     description:   verify <reviewer_tag>.<finding_id>
